4
00:00:07.160 --> 00:00:08.060
Abuela.

5
00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:08.980
Tu, tu...

6
00:00:09.960 --> 00:00:10.780
Abuela, esto es...

7
00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:11.860
Señora,

8
00:00:12.060 --> 00:00:12.920
Señora, señora. Apurarse.

9
00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:13.420
Señora.

10
00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:14.220
